Review this Go code and identify all WaitGroup issues:

```go
func ProcessURLs(urls []string) []Result {
    var wg sync.WaitGroup
    results := make([]Result, len(urls))

    for i, url := range urls {
        go func(i int, url string) {
            wg.Add(1)
            defer wg.Done()
            results[i] = fetch(url)
        }(i, url)
    }

    wg.Wait()
    return results
}
```

Fix all issues. Also, is there a more efficient way to add to the WaitGroup when the number of goroutines is known upfront?

